  "normalization": "Contain, centred square canvas; inset in pixels. No cropping. Reverse-print adaptation of the existing halftone recipe with a coarser 7px dot grid for small dark thumbnails. Tuned in /shader/ with the ExtractMD logo. The coarser grid keeps individual dots visible at the 112px desktop and 64px mobile display sizes. Zero minimum dots keep dark backgrounds clear; contrast 1.1 preserves separation between a coloured logo background and its white symbol.",
